            title: "The Decade Nobody Warned You About",
            content: "Imagine your body's most sophisticated communication network slowly changing its broadcast schedule — for 4 to 10 years — while nobody tells you it's happening. That's **perimenopause**, and it blindsides millions of women every year.\n\nThe average age of menopause is **51**, but the transition often starts in the early-to-mid 40s. Hot flashes get the headlines, but the full story includes sleep that falls apart, mood swings that feel random, brain fog that makes you doubt yourself, and joints that ache for no reason.\n\nHere's what makes this lesson different: you're going to get the honest, evidence-based version — including the real story of hormone therapy, one of the most misunderstood treatments in modern medicine. By the end, you'll understand what's happening, why, and what actually helps.",
