            content: "Pull down to refresh. Wait. Will there be a new like? A new message? Nothing? That tiny moment of suspense is not an accident — it is a **variable reward schedule**, the exact mechanism casinos use in slot machines, engineered into your phone.\n\nThe target is a molecule: **dopamine**. And almost everything you have heard about it is wrong. Dopamine is not the 'pleasure chemical.' It is the **wanting** chemical — and once you see the difference, you will understand why you keep scrolling even when it stopped being fun.\n\nIn this lesson you will meet the three behavior-shaping messengers: dopamine (drive and craving), **oxytocin** (bonding and stress-buffering), and **serotonin** — about 90% of which is made not in your brain, but in your gut. You will also see the 2024 evidence that movement rivals medication for mild depression. Your mood has chemistry. And you have levers.",
